<title>JAPAN: Nissho Electronics - 6mth group results.</title>
<headline>Nissho Electronics - 6mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 22.44		vs	   18.26</p>
<p> Operating	    1.03		vs	    1.07</p>
<p> Current		1.13		vs	    1.10</p>
<p> Net		  489    million	  vs	  450    million</p>
<p> EPS		   28.54 yen	  vs	   26.92 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nissho Electronics Corp is a trading firm specialising in electronic products.</p>
</text>
